---
description: Preserve PostgreSQL and Prisma ownership boundaries per service.
globs: apps/**/prisma/**/*.prisma
alwaysApply: false
---

# Database Ownership

- Keep one Prisma schema and one database URL per business service.
- Add models only to the service that owns their lifecycle and writes.
- Repositories are the only layer that performs Prisma/database access.
- Use migrations for schema changes; do not rely on manual production database edits.
- Add indexes and transaction boundaries only when query patterns or consistency requirements justify them.
- Never connect one service to another service's database URL.
